---
layout: base.njk
schemaSession: true
---

<header class="page-header"
  data-aeo-label="Event schema · This header is mapped to Schema.org Event (sub-event) JSON-LD. The title, summary, date, location, and speaker data are machine-readable, helping AI engines answer queries like 'What sessions are at Airspace World 2026?'">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Session{% if theme %} · {{ theme }}{% endif %}</p>
    <h1
      data-aeo-label="Primary entity name · The page title is the session's canonical entity. AI engines match it against conference agenda queries and index it as a named Event. Consistent with the JSON-LD name field above.">
      {{ title }}
    </h1>
    <p>{{ summary }}</p>
    <dl class="detail-meta" aria-label="Session details"
      data-aeo-label="Structured metadata · Day, time, room, and speaker are in a definition list — machine-readable key/value pairs. AI engines extract these to answer scheduling questions like 'What time is the SESAR session?' without needing to parse prose.">
      <div><strong>Day</strong> · {{ day }}</div>
      <div><strong>Time</strong> · {{ time }}</div>
      <div><strong>Room</strong> · {{ room }}</div>
      {% if speakers %}<div><strong>Speakers</strong> · {{ speakers }}</div>{% endif %}
    </dl>
  </div>
</header>

<section>
  <div class="container">
    <article class="prose"
      data-aeo-label="Body content · This article is where AI citation happens. Each H2 becomes a candidate answer to a topic query. FAQ-style H2 + paragraph pairs are the highest-value citation targets — AI engines prefer structured Q&A over long prose.">
      {{ content | safe }}
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-tight" style="border-bottom: 0;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="maxifi-cta"
      data-aeo-label="Internal link equity · Cross-links to /sessions/ and /themes/ pass entity association signals. AI engines use link graphs to determine which pages are authoritative on a topic — more internal links from relevant pages = stronger topical authority.">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Browse the agenda</p>
        <h2>All sessions at ASW 2026</h2>
        <p>See every session indexed in this hub, or jump to the related theme.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="maxifi-cta-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/sessions/">All sessions →</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/themes/">Browse themes</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
